{% comment %}
首页主视觉，对应 templates/index.json 中 type 为 cyd-hero 的区块。
每个 section.blocks 条目是一张轮播，图文与关联商品读取 block.settings，schema 声明编辑器可配置的字段。
cyd-store.js 处理切换按钮和滑动，cyd-store.css 控制桌面分栏及手机上下排版。
{% endcomment %}
{% comment %}首屏轮播由 Shopify 主题编辑器管理；没有配置图片时显示随主题提供的品牌图。{% endcomment %}
<section class="cyd-hero page-width" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.hero' | t }}">
  <cyd-carousel>
    <div class="cyd-hero__track" id="CydSlides-{{ section.id }}" tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.track' | t }}">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {% comment %}
        跳转目标优先使用自定义链接，其次关联商品，再回退到演示系列或全部商品。首张图立即加载，其余图片懒加载。
        {% endcomment %}
        {%- liquid
          assign image = block.settings.image
          assign media_alt = image.alt | default: ''
          assign target = block.settings.link | default: block.settings.product.url | default: collections['cyd-preview-catalog'].url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
          assign loading = 'lazy'
          if forloop.first
            assign loading = 'eager'
          endif
        -%}
        {% comment %}
        shopify_attributes 把轮播内容块关联到主题编辑器的选中与重排操作，新增包装元素时保留该属性。
        {% endcomment %}
        <article class="cyd-hero__slide{% if image == blank and block.settings.default_art == 'brand' %} cyd-hero__slide--brand{% endif %}" id="CydSlide-{{ block.id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <div class="cyd-hero__copy">
            {%- if block.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="cyd-eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            <h2>{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
            {%- if block.settings.description != blank -%}<p class="cyd-hero__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
            <a class="cyd-hero__action" href="{{ target }}">{{ block.settings.cta | escape }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          {% comment %}
          媒体选择依次为后台主图、两张内置轮播素材、品牌图形。手机专用图由 picture 的 source 控制。
          {% endcomment %}
          <div class="cyd-hero__art">
            {%- if image != blank -%}
              <picture>
                {%- if block.settings.mobile_image != blank -%}
                  <source media="(max-width: 749px)" srcset="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 840 }}">
                {%- endif -%}
                {{ image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: widths: '480, 750, 960, 1280, 1600', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 60vw, 100vw', loading: loading, alt: media_alt }}
              </picture>
            {%- elsif block.settings.default_art == 'banner-1' -%}
              <img src="{{ 'cyd-banner-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="cyd-hero__photo" width="1262" height="1440" alt="" loading="{{ loading }}">
            {%- elsif block.settings.default_art == 'banner-2' -%}
              <img src="{{ 'cyd-banner-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" class="cyd-hero__photo" width="1262" height="1440" alt="" loading="{{ loading }}">
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="cyd-hero__art-label" aria-hidden="true">CYD DESIGN<br>ART COLLECTION</span>
              <img src="{{ 'cyd-world-art.png' | asset_url }}" class="cyd-hero__stones" width="420" height="254" alt="">
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </article>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 1 -%}
      <div class="cyd-hero__controls">
        <div class="cyd-hero__dots" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.choose_slide' | t }}">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            <a href="#CydSlide-{{ block.id }}" data-cyd-slide="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.slide' | t: index: forloop.index, title: block.settings.heading | escape }}"{% if forloop.first %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}><span></span></a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="cyd-hero__arrows">
          <button type="button" data-cyd-step="-1" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.previous' | t }}" aria-controls="CydSlides-{{ section.id }}">←</button>
          <button type="button" data-cyd-step="1" aria-label="{{ 'cyd.home.next' | t }}" aria-controls="CydSlides-{{ section.id }}">→</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </cyd-carousel>
</section>

{% comment %}
后台设置面板的字段定义。这里的 id 必须与上面 block.settings 的名称、模板 JSON 保存的字段一致。
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "CYD 主视觉轮播",
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["index"] },
  "max_blocks": 6,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slide",
      "name": "轮播图",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "主图" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "mobile_image", "label": "手机裁切图（可选）" },
        { "type": "select", "id": "default_art", "label": "未选主图时的素材", "default": "brand", "options": [
          { "value": "brand", "label": "品牌图形" },
          { "value": "banner-1", "label": "商城轮播素材一" },
          { "value": "banner-2", "label": "商城轮播素材二" }
        ] },
        { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "上方文字", "default": "CYD DESIGN / 商城" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "标题", "default": "把艺术带进日常" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "description", "label": "说明" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "cta", "label": "按钮", "default": "探索全部商品" },
        { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "关联商品" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "自定义链接", "info": "优先于关联商品" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "CYD 主视觉轮播", "blocks": [{ "type": "slide" }] }]
}
{% endschema %}
